  "title": "Display Properties – block, inline, inline-block",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Course: CSS Fundamentals for Your First Webpage"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Display Properties – block, inline, inline-block"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Before layouts, developers ask:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Why is this element taking full width? Why is this one not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The answer usually starts with a display."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "What You're Already Seeing"
    },
    {
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "items": [
        "<div>, <section>, <p> → block",
        "<span>, <a> → inline"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "You didn't choose this — HTML did."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Practical Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<article>\n2  <h2>Understanding Display</h2>\n3  <p>\n4    <span>Spans stay inline</span>\n5    and flow with text.\n6  </p>\n7\n8  <div class=\"tag\">HTML</div>\n9  <div class=\"tag\">CSS</div>\n10  <div class=\"tag\">Layout</div>\n11</article>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "1article {\n2  display: block;\n3}\n4\n5span {\n6  display: inline;\n7}\n8\n9.tag {\n10  display: inline-block;\n11  padding: 6px 12px;\n12}"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Developer Intuition"
    },
    {
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "items": [
        "block → full width, stacks vertically",
        "inline → flows with text",
        "inline-block → inline, but can have size"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "That's enough for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": "How does it work?"
    },
